<section class="ziyu-section">
  <div class="ziyu-container">
    <div class="ziyu-legal-hero">
      <span class="ziyu-label">Privacy Policy</span>

      <h1 class="ziyu-h1">
        Privacy as a digital sanctuary.
      </h1>

      <p class="ziyu-body-lg">
        We believe personal data should be treated as something to protect, not something to extract.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="ziyu-legal-layout">

      <aside class="ziyu-legal-sidebar">
        <a href="#data">Data</a>
        <a href="#sanctuary">Sanctuary</a>
        <a href="#services">Services</a>
        <a href="#rights">Rights</a>
      </aside>

      <div class="ziyu-legal-content">

        <section id="data" class="ziyu-legal-block">
          <span class="ziyu-label">01 Data</span>

          <h2 class="ziyu-h3">
            The Minimalist Approach
          </h2>

          <p class="ziyu-body-lg">
            We collect only what is essential to provide a useful and intentional experience. If information does not serve the quality of your experience, we do not ask for it.
          </p>

          <ul class="ziyu-legal-list">
            <li>No third-party advertising cookies.</li>
            <li>No selling personal data to advertisers or brokers.</li>
            <li>Preference-based data collection only when needed.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section id="sanctuary" class="ziyu-legal-block">
          <span class="ziyu-label">02 Sanctuary</span>

          <h2 class="ziyu-h3">
            Digital Sanctuary
          </h2>

          <p class="ziyu-body-lg">
            Security and privacy should be integrated into the product experience from the beginning, not added later as an afterthought.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section id="services" class="ziyu-legal-block">
          <span class="ziyu-label">03 Services</span>

          <h2 class="ziyu-h3">
            Third-Party Services
          </h2>

          <p class="ziyu-body-lg">
            When outside providers are required for hosting, payments, analytics, or infrastructure, we aim to choose partners that respect privacy and security.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section id="rights" class="ziyu-legal-block">
          <span class="ziyu-label">04 Rights</span>

          <h2 class="ziyu-h3">
            User Rights
          </h2>

          <p class="ziyu-body-lg">
            You may request access, correction, export, or deletion of your data.
          </p>

          <button class="ziyu-button ziyu-button--ghost">
            Request Data Export
          </button>
        </section>

      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="ziyu-section ziyu-section--dark">
  <div class="ziyu-manifesto">
    <span class="ziyu-label" style="color: rgba(255,255,255,.7);">
      Our Promise
    </span>

    <h2 class="ziyu-h2">
      Ziyu is funded by products and supporters, not surveillance.
    </h2>

    <p style="margin-top: 24px; color: rgba(255,255,255,.78);">
      We will not build the ecosystem around exploiting your attention.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Privacy",
  "settings": [],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Privacy"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}